luci-app-cloudflare-ip-2.6.0-r8 description:
OpenWrt plugin for automatically selecting the fastest Cloudflare IPs using CloudflareSpeedTest, and updating PassWall or OpenClash proxy configurations. Includes Native, Adaptive Measurement, Operational Health, and the optional Candidate Rill consumer integration. The Rill Runtime binary remains an independently packaged optional dependency.

